[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3179468283","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109540#issuecomment-3179468283","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109540","id":3179468283,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69gtX7","user":{"login":"Jordyfel","id":76705401,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzA1NDAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76705401?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordyfel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordyfel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-12T13:58:38Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T13:58:38Z","body":"I've been wondering why `is_action_just_pressed()` is not available in `InputEvent`, but only the `Input` singleton. In case there isn't a technical reason for this, it might be better to implement there.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3179468283/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3179478277","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109540#issuecomment-3179478277","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109540","id":3179478277,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69gv0F","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-12T14:01:01Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T14:01:01Z","body":"> I've been wondering why is_action_just_pressed() is not available in InputEvent, but only the Input singleton. In case there isn't a technical reason for this, it might be better to implement there.\r\n\r\nThis might be something we should consider in the future, but won't work with the current implementation, and I'm trying to make minimal changes since we are in a beta feature freeze.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3179478277/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3179553564","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109540#issuecomment-3179553564","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109540","id":3179553564,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69hCMc","user":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-12T14:18:40Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T14:18:40Z","body":"> I've been wondering why `is_action_just_pressed()` is not available in `InputEvent`, but only the `Input` singleton. In case there isn't a technical reason for this, it might be better to implement there.\r\n\r\nWhen you receive an `InputEvent` (for example within the `_unhandled_input` function), then the associated action has been triggered in this frame, so I don't see any reason for implementing it there, since there is already [`InputEvent.is_action_pressed()`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_inputevent.html#class-inputevent-method-is-action-pressed), which already achieves that.\r\n\r\nYou use `Input.is_action_just_pressed()` within `_process` to check in each frame the Input singleton, if any actions have been triggered.\r\n\r\nOne thing, that has always bothered me, is that `is_action_just_pressed()` needs to be checked in every frame, while you can achieve the same effect, listening to the actual `InputEvents` in `_unhandled_input`.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3179553564/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3180211879","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109540#issuecomment-3180211879","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109540","id":3180211879,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69ji6n","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-12T16:55:21Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T16:55:21Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3180211879/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3217755172","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109540#issuecomment-3217755172","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109540","id":3217755172,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_ywwk","user":{"login":"apanascx","id":121946314,"node_id":"U_kgDOB0TAyg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121946314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/apanascx","html_url":"https://github.com/apanascx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apanascx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apanascx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apanascx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apanascx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apanascx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apanascx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apanascx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apanascx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/apanascx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-24T04:22:54Z","updated_at":"2025-08-24T04:22:54Z","body":"I think there's a copy+paste issue with the documentation.  The following note under  `is_action_just_pressed_by_event` mentions `is_action_just_pressed` instead of `is_action_just_pressed_by_event`.\r\n\r\n```\r\n[b]Note:[/b] Due to keyboard ghosting, [method is_action_just_pressed] may return [code]false[/code] even if one of the action's keys is pressed. See [url=$DOCS_URL/tutorials/inputs/input_examples.html#keyboard-events]Input examples[/url] in the documentation for more information.\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3217755172/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":